(50,'',NULL,'what is the status','','','',NULL,'I\'m not finding a reliable match for that in the available Labor Law Reference or HR Policy records in the HRMS.\n\nCould you rephrase your question or tell me the HR topic you\'re asking about? For example, you can ask about:\n\n• Labor laws (overtime, leave, safety, etc.)\n• Company policies (remote work, data privacy, code of conduct, etc.)','LOW','2026-09-24 00:29:18'),
(51,'',NULL,'remote work policy','','','policy',NULL,'I found a matching HR policy in the system:\n\n<strong>Remote Work Policy</strong>\n\n<strong>Policy Code:</strong> POL-DATA-001\n<strong>Status:</strong> Published\n<strong>Version:</strong> 1.0\n<strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2026\n\nGuidelines for remote work arrangements, eligibility, and expectations.\n\n\n\n<strong>Source:</strong> HR Policy (Published)','HIGH','2026-09-24 00:29:20'),
