ted to this notice.\n\nRegards,\nDaniel R. Reyes\nHR Directress\n\n---\nThis is a system-generated NTE for academic demonstration purposes.\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Unknown\nSubject: No subject','warning',NULL,0,'compliance','enriquezblythe@gmail.com','2026-10-19 22:00:02','2026-10-19 22:00:02'),
